{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06768","headline":"宴南亭 · 王昌龄","name":"宴南亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒江暎村林，亭上纳鲜洁。\n楚客共闲饮，静坐金管阕。\n酣竟日入山，暝来云归穴。\n城楼空杳霭，猿鸟备清切。\n物状如丝纶，上心爲予决。\n访君东溪事，早晚樵路绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}